{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Game About Penguins</strong> is a cozy, online multiplayer sandbox where you play as a customizable penguin and dive into hilarious, heartwarming adventures with your friends. Explore snowy landscapes, play mini-games, and express yourself in the cutest way possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/01-ENG.png?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waddle through snowy villages, slide down icy hills, or give your friends a playful slap to send them tumbling. It\u2019s all part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-01.gif?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/02-ENG.png?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cast your line and relax as you fish in icy waters. Catch rare creatures, fill your journal, and earn rewards along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-02.gif?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/03-ENG.png?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock outfits, colors, hats, and accessories to create your own unique penguin style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-03.gif?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/05-ENG.png?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather around the campfire, dance, emote, or just vibe with friends in a warm and snowy social hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-05.gif?t=1751649295\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617840?t=1751649295","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/68ea839b2365c11ad21e6640d31ca2ced24b6c5f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751649295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/b455eadd74a61b4d82bb99f2a55f25ce853f42c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751649295","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/b455eadd74a61b4d82bb99f2a55f25ce853f42c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751649295","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3763800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Game About Penguins</strong> is a cozy, online multiplayer sandbox where you play as a customizable penguin and dive into hilarious, heartwarming adventures with your friends. Explore snowy landscapes, play mini-games, and express yourself in the cutest way possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/01-ENG.png?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waddle through snowy villages, slide down icy hills, or give your friends a playful slap to send them tumbling. It\u2019s all part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-01.gif?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/02-ENG.png?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cast your line and relax as you fish in icy waters. Catch rare creatures, fill your journal, and earn rewards along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-02.gif?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/03-ENG.png?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock outfits, colors, hats, and accessories to create your own unique penguin style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-03.gif?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/05-ENG.png?t=1751649295\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_para